        {
          "text": "Mumuyika kwakhataru kwaAsa omuruchi waYuda, Baasha waAhiya yachaaka okhuruchila Isiraeli yosi eTiriza, naruka emiyika amakhumi kabili nachine. ",
          "type": "text",
